# Dart

- Widgets: `StatelessWidget` unless state is required, then Cubit.
- Cubit file + state file. Use `equatable`. Provide via `BlocProvider` at the feature or app root.
- Read cubit with `context.read<X>()`. Listen with `BlocBuilder` / `BlocListener`.
- Navigation: `context.go(RouteNames.x)` or `context.push(RouteNames.x)`.
- Colors: `AppColors.*`. Text: `Theme.of(context).textTheme` or `AppFonts`. Logo: `AppLogo` / `AppAssets.logo`.
- Breakpoints: `Responsive.isMobile/isTablet/isDesktop(context)`.
- One class per file. Constructor `const` when possible.
- No print. No unused imports. No commented-out code.
